Doi (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAZI">doi</a>:<a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://doi.org/10.1007%2F978-1-4020-4938-5_3" class="external text" id="mwAZM">10.1007/978-1-4020-4938-5_3</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAZQ">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAZU"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-1-4020-4937-8" title="Special:BookSources/978-1-4020-4937-8" id="mwAZY"><bdi id="mwAZc">978-1-4020-4937-8</bdi></a><span class="reference-accessdate" id="mwAZg">. Retrieved <span class="nowrap" id="mwAZk">25 June</span> 2010</span>. <q id="mwAZo">Toulmin's 1958 work is essential in the field of argumentation</q></cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=A+Citation-Based+Reflection+on+Toulmin+and+Argument&amp;rft.btitle=Arguing+on+the+Toulmin+Model%3A+New+Essays+in+Argument+Analysis+and+Evaluation&amp;rft.pages=31-38&amp;rft.pub=Springer+Netherlands&amp;rft.date=2006&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2F978-1-4020-4938-5_3&amp;rft.isbn=978-1-4020-4937-8&amp;rft.aulast=Loui&amp;rft.aufirst=Ronald+P.&amp;rft_id=https%3A%2F%2Fbooks.google.com%2Fbooks%3Fid%3D3xE5ichwr5MC%26pg%3DPA31&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AStephen+Toulmin" class="Z3988" about="#mwt12" id="mwAZs"></span></span></li>
