70-2" class="external text" id="mwAfw">10.1007/978-1-4020-6670-2</a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)" title="ISBN (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAf0">ISBN</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAf4"> </span><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:BookSources/9781402066696" title="Special:BookSources/9781402066696" id="mwAf8"><bdi id="mwAgA">9781402066696</bdi></a>. <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/OCLC_(identifier)" title="OCLC (identifier)" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAgE">OCLC</a><span typeof="mw:Entity" id="mwAgI"> </span><a rel="mw:ExtLink nofollow" href="https://search.worldcat.org/oclc/171556540" class="external text" id="mwAgM">171556540</a>.</cite><span title="ctx_ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft_val_fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=Argumentation+in+Science+Education%3A+Perspectives+from+Classroom-Based+Research&amp;rft.place=New+York&amp;rft.series=Science+%26+Technology+Education+Library&amp;rft.pages=15-16&amp;rft.pub=Springer-Verlag&amp;rft.date=2007&amp;rft_id=info%3Aoclcnum%2F171556540&amp;rft_id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1007%2F978-1-4020-6670-2&amp;rft.isbn=9781402066696&amp;rfr_id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AStephen+Toulmin" class="Z3988" about="#mwt45" id="mwAgQ"></span></span></li>
